From b54683c780b855721cc802b9dac319315ef8ca18 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: J P <jpwatters@mac.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 20:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 31/43] Project PDF for v1.26.1-NAS

The PDF is now built by tools/nas-kit/doc/build_pdf.py from project.md, the
folder's git history (change history) and its code (listings), so it names
the release it describes. New section 9, "Keeping up with upstream: what each
release changed", lists for every port from v1.20.5 to v1.26.1 what stopped
the patches and how it was resolved. Section 3 explains the relay's
discovery fix (answers from the arrival interface, so the NAS's VPN client no
longer hides it); the verification table and the sources are brought up to
date (M5Stack W5500 docs, IP_PKTINFO and policy routing, the Helix MP3
component).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01W7MAsxUnuCnfwkHxdqp61S
---
